{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短停留段，未标注到时出现的感受词仍然偏密，容易分散观众对人物主线的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点加亮让人物每一阶段的核心心理更容易被抓住，而且把想靠近、害怕负担、逐渐放松、渴望互相依靠、接受不确定这些心理变化衔接得更清楚。分时出现的感受词也更能对应音乐的具体起伏，让情绪有了细腻的身体感和时间感，而不只是给情绪贴标签。扫描效率上，X的左右分栏更直接，Y的重点突出和感受字缩小则更利于抓主线，两者各有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55bdfb19-b32b-4b8a-a59c-89ff8e5c9ff3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T014403418996Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:45:28.581622+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0bc8cfa26f224631c64d0fc7957f0496d5b7bef58ec5ac3018503f0b156b25e7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed